              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba akaba atwara ebyanga byona ebyabaire biri seenu y'omugyera Furaati, okuruga Tifusa, okuhika Gaaza, kandi n'abagabe boona abaabaire bari seenu y'ogwo mugyera; kandi akaba aine obusingye aha mbaju zoona. ",
          "type": "text",
