        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Ruhanga yaaha Sulemaani obwengye n'okwetegyereza ebitakareebwaga, kandi n'omutima ogwine okushoborokyerwa kwingi munonga nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; ",
          "type": "text",
