              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi akaba naakiza n'abandi boona obwengye, nka Esaani Omunyaezerahi, na Hemani, Katukooli na Darada beene Mahooli; eiziina rye ryarangaanwa omu mahanga goona agaabaire gamwehinguririize. ",
          "type": "text",
